AWS service	Azure alternative

1. EC2 (virtual machines)	             Azure Virtual Machines
2. S3 (object storage)	               Azure Blob Storage
3. EBS (block storage)	               Azure Managed Disks
4. EFS (shared file storage)	         Azure Files
5. VPC (virtual network)	             Azure Virtual Network (VNet)
6. Security Groups	                   Network Security Groups (NSGs)
7. IAM (identity and access)	         Microsoft Entra ID + Azure RBAC
8. Route 53 (DNS)	                     Azure DNS
9. Elastic Load Balancing	             Azure Load Balancer / Application Gateway
10. Auto Scaling	                     Virtual Machine Scale Sets
11. ECS / EKS (containers)	           Azure Container Apps / AKS
12. ECR (container registry)	         Azure Container Registry (ACR)
13. RDS (managed databases)	           Azure SQL Database / Azure Database for PostgreSQL
14. Lambda (serverless functions)	     Azure Functions
15. CloudWatch (monitoring)	           Azure Monitor
16. CloudTrail (audit logs)	           Azure Activity Log
17. AWS Backup	                       Azure Backup
18. CloudFormation	                   Azure Resource Manager (ARM) / Bicep
